<title>JAPAN: AUG NIKKEI 225 OPTIONS SETTLED AT 19,277.63 -- OSE.</title>
<headline>AUG NIKKEI 225 OPTIONS SETTLED AT 19,277.63 -- OSE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>August Nikkei 225 options were settled at 19,277.63 on Friday, the Osaka Securities Exchange (OSE) said.</p>
<p>The OSE also said Nikkei 300 options were settled at 290.71.</p>
</text>
